ribes the unhealthy release, the target version, the two failed rollback attempts, and that nothing has changed. It also says the next step is a manual rollback to v2.3.0 or investigating the 503s.\n\nThe rollback tool itself is returning 503s, so someone needs to run the rollback manually or wait for the tool to recover. I can retry it once the platform is back.", "type": "text"}]}]}